  "title": "Krisna T NDE 3909",
  "date": "06/06/2006",
  "content": "My boyfriend at the time was driving the truck. We were heading home from the bar when he lost control of the vehicle and it rolled three times. My seatbelt busted and I was ejected. I have no memory of the accident but what I do recall is floating outside my body. The backside of my body was to me. I felt something (what I know now was an angel) wrap around my arms and legs. I started being pulled back into my body when I was overwhelmed with the feeling of peace and calm. I knew that I was in an accident that I was protected and that I would survive. I suffered nineteen broken bones (all to the torso) and internal injuries. Not one limb was broke or scraped.",
